    "title": "Fastest Self-Hostable Workflow Engine",
    "html": "<p>We have compared Windmill to other self-hostable workflow engines (Airflow,\nPrefect &amp; Temporal) and Windmill is the most performant solution for both\nbenchmarks: one flow composed of 40 lightweight tasks &amp; one flow composed of 10\nlong-running tasks.</p>\n<p>All methodology &amp; results on our\n<a href=\"https://www.windmill.dev/docs/misc/benchmarks/competitors#airflow-setup\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Benchmarks</a>\npage.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/windmill-labs/windmill/main/imgs/fastest.png\" alt=\"Fastest workflow engine\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>",
